{"journal_version":1,"sequence":10,"replace_from":14,"message_count":15,"messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":"Verification passed.\n\n**Change (app/page.tsx):**\n- Replaced the labeled right-side control buttons with an icon-only toolbar (`variant=\"ghost\" size=\"icon\"`, each with `aria-label`/`title` for accessibility) in a `sticky top-0` container with a bottom border and background, scoped to the right column (`col-span-2 … overflow-y-auto`), so it stays pinned to the top of the right section without overlapping the left sidebar.\n- Added a search icon button fixed at the far right of that toolbar (justify-between) plus a new `SearchIcon` SVG component.\n- Moved each sidebar row's `<time>` into a flex header row beside the sender name, so the date sits top-right on the same line as the sender.\n\n**Commands run:** `npm run verify:agent` → exit 0, \"render smoke passed: HTTP 200\".\n\n**Remaining risks:** The verification is only a render smoke check (no visual/interaction assertions), and the toolbar relies on `sticky` within the right column's scroll container rather than viewport-`fixed` positioning to avoid covering the sidebar; if the design expects `fixed`, absolute coordinates would be needed.","response_items":[{"id":"a5fda495-3040-439e-b350-b0621df2531c","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"Verification passed.\n\n**Change (app/page.tsx):**\n- Replaced the labeled right-side control buttons with an icon-only toolbar (`variant=\"ghost\" size=\"icon\"`, each with `aria-label`/`title` for accessibility) in a `sticky top-0` container with a bottom border and background, scoped to the right column (`col-span-2 … overflow-y-auto`), so it stays pinned to the top of the right section without overlapping the left sidebar.\n- Added a search icon button fixed at the far right of that toolbar (justify-between) plus a new `SearchIcon` SVG component.\n- Moved each sidebar row's `<time>` into a flex header row beside the sender name, so the date sits top-right on